1
00:00:00,782 --> 00:00:03,022
(Raj:)Now, where does your mom
keep the Crisco?

2
00:00:03,185 --> 00:00:04,125
(Howard:)I don't know.

3
00:00:04,286 --> 00:00:06,126
(Howard:)Probably in a wad in her cheek.

4
00:00:07,789 --> 00:00:10,429
(Bernadette:)I'll help Raj in here.
Why don't you go keep my dad company?

5
00:00:10,592 --> 00:00:12,902
Oh, he doesn't want me in there.
I'm the creepy little guy

6
00:00:13,061 --> 00:00:15,371
(Howard:)who has sex with his daughter.

7
00:00:17,532 --> 00:00:19,812
(Bernadette:)-Don't be silly, he loves you.
-Does he?

8
00:00:19,968 --> 00:00:22,378
(Bernadette:)-Okay, he cares about you a lot.
-Really?

9
00:00:22,537 --> 00:00:25,607
(Bernadette:)I do crap for you all the time.
Get out there.

10
00:00:31,246 --> 00:00:34,456
(Howard:)So your wife's in Arizona
with the grandkids?

11
00:00:34,883 --> 00:00:35,793
(Mike:)Uh-huh.

12
00:00:38,987 --> 00:00:41,097
(Howard:)You know, my mom's been to Arizona.

13
00:00:41,256 --> 00:00:43,796
(Howard:)She rode one of those mules
down in the Grand Canyon.

14
00:00:43,959 --> 00:00:46,629
(Howard:)Long story short,
they had to shoot it.

15
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:53,116
Because she's so fat.

16
00:00:57,606 --> 00:01:03,026
(Howard:)I'll get the door
while you finish laughing.

